{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-02_end","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-02","title":"破解錘砧戰術","storyCode":"14-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"8076abe619f5ca178961115db12bfd3fe3ba7f3238b4f408de3072032d3b092a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"行動開始後二十三小時"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g25_wildbattlefield_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前進路線清掃完畢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":true,"text":"我正在偵察薩卡茲的動向，暫時沒有發現他們留下的痕跡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你，Misery先生，請繼續布置哨位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你那邊有沒有發現活著的維多利亞士兵？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"除了源石結晶，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在進入西途林地以後，我們沒有遇到哪怕一支維多利亞人的隊伍，連屍體和載具殘骸都幾乎見不到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀羅","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見鬼！明明看起來打得這麼激烈，人都上哪去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的地形還在一刻不停地變化，也許是……大地吃掉了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能低估人們的頑強。正因為有不願放棄的人，才會有典範軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也才會在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉，請繼續讓醫療兵做好接收殘軍和平民的準備。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們的物資還算是有些富餘，這方面可以放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但，壞消息是，鑒於現在隊伍裡感染者的數量，我們就快區分不了感染者士兵和非感染者士兵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你的專業意見。登記感染者還能不能幫到我們的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":true,"text":"哈哈。“登記感染者”……這幾乎是我在軍校學到的第一課。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"希勒少尉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1070_1","isRemote":true,"text":"但情況擺在這裡了。我得說，意義不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。那就別再登記了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人，無論是否已經感染，都盡量按照羅德島的建議做好防護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的……就不是我們當前能決定的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先活著打贏眼前這場仗。未來的仗，未來再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的無人機回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛克十八","speakerId":"avg_npc_424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……糟透了，整個動力系統裡都卡滿了結晶粉塵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看監測儀的數據，環境中源石濃度的漲落還是非常劇烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛洛，把最新的數據發給我，我們又更新了一版活性化源石發展趨勢的模型，看看這次的演算結果能不能擬合得上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，看來數據量還是不夠，這個曲線的走勢……等維克多他們那裡衍射儀的分析報告出來，我們應該就能即時計算出安全區的位置了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片鬼地方，也許上一秒看起來風平浪靜，下一秒就會從地裡長出什麼恐怖的源石大山。安全區的位置一直在變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在雖然短距離的通訊已經勉強恢復，但是距離稍微長一點，通訊還是會有干擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧我有先見之明，在來倫蒂尼姆之前，找Raidian討了她的施術單元，稍微仿製了一下……效果雖然不如正版，但夠幫上忙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到我們的幾座便攜通訊塔都豎起來，安全區的地點就能發送給戰場上每一個有需要的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個訊息能救很多人的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我們羅德島就是幹這個的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐，情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們已經成功登陸吉布森鎮。這裡是我們進入銀石崖前線之前的最後一個補給點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"偵察小隊進行了初步的探索，確認有公爵聯軍殘留的痕跡，他們應該是在數天前途經這裡開赴前線的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"“灰禮帽”之前同步給我們的行進方向確實是安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮上有停留人員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"街道上是空的，但我能察覺到晃動的人影和食物的氣息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我們沒有貿然接觸，以免產生不必要的誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，我們會盡快與你們會合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天快黑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，如果一切順利，我們的戰士還能稍作休息，喝上一碗熱湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記得給我的人留點，他們忙完再趕回來還要點時間。洛洛和我也還得去費斯特那裡一趟……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上說不定能把通訊範圍再擴大一倍，我們想辦法盡早完工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我們一定把最好的菜留給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……反正也就是罐頭軍糧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要抽點戰車裡的機油給你當佐料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王＆洛洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各隊伍注意，繼續前進，進入吉布森鎮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望這一夜……可以和現在一樣平靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的房子看起來都沒人，原本的居民都躲起來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉布森鎮離公爵們的防線不遠，應該沒有被薩卡茲完全佔領過，更何況聯軍幾天前才通過了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但號角小姐的謹慎是對的，也許有之前掉隊的公爵殘部因為想追上大部隊而進入這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們雖然收到了“灰禮帽”的建議，但維多利亞向來不是鐵板一塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，典範軍內部的情況還相當複雜，有些古板的軍事貴族未必能容忍我們的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展示出我們的規模能讓居心叵測的人先掂量掂量自己，也能讓需要援助的人知道我們來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"戰車行駛的聲音迴盪在沉默的夜色中，引擎的低鳴沉穩而有力。\n戰士們小心地前進著，觀察著四周，所見的依然只有一扇扇漆黑的窗戶與門洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來他們不想主動與我們接觸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也好，如果能相安無事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，有聲音，左前方的建築裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是炮彈彈殼落地的聲音！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埋伏？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家戒備，我帶人去探路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一、第二小隊，跟上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"narration","text":"已經廢棄的工廠裡，沒有半點人影。\n彈殼落地的聲音消失後，也沒有預想的爆炸聲傳來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"號角小姐，你確定那是彈殼落地的聲音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很確定，而且，那是維多利亞精銳部隊才會配給的特殊型號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有發現有人生活的痕跡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，停步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"推進之王剛抬起的腳又小心地放回了原地。\n號角指向地面上微不可察的，一條細細的絆線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藏得很好，這條絆線剛好被管道擋住，很難發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"詭雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……沒有連接爆炸裝置，是個簡易的報警系統。但看設置的手法，是專業的軍事人員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘗試交流看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，站在我們後面，其他人，做好作戰準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，我們沒有惡意——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這支部隊的番號是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暗門！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備進入，跟住盾牌！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維多利亞士兵？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"幫、幫幫我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是在觀察的時候不小心碰掉了樓上的廢彈殼，這他們都聽得到！你設置的報警器他們也沒撞上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支隊伍，恐怕不是那些一般的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她……她能擋開你的破城矛？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長？還有推進之王？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……菲奧娜，真的是你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"紅色長髮的女孩猛然撲進她的隊長的懷中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原來，你們都還活著……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，真的太好了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"號角輕輕鬆開了風笛，卻又捏了捏她的肩膀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，沒受傷，也沒瘦多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報、報告隊長！我做到了，我把鬼魂部隊的情報帶了出去，我還查清楚了他們到底想幹什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我活了下來，帶著記憶，帶著真相，一直活著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的命令……我一個字都沒忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我知道你能做到，從來都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——風笛，歡迎歸隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……？你們到底——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，都請出來吧，我們沒有惡意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個個人影從黑暗中走了出來。\n老人，孩子，傷患，病人，平民。\n成百上千雙眼睛帶著畏懼與好奇打量著推進之王等人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是公爵的部隊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你們不少人沒穿維多利亞的軍裝，怎麼還有工人打扮的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們不隸屬於任何一位公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這支部隊的番號是，“典範軍”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希勒少尉正在統計藏在工廠裡的平民的人數和身體情況。只能說，比我們預計的要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了和你一起過來的那些法夫公爵的感染者殘兵，還有一小隊諾曼底公爵的工兵，其他都是本地的平民，沒跑得掉的那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明公爵的聯軍前幾天剛經過這裡，他們卻寧願放棄可能被救援的機會，也不願意尋求大公爵們的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍人們還好理解，無論是擔心自己的感染狀況，還是擔心軍事條令的處罰，都算是有個理由。可是平民們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一年，也許倫蒂尼姆周圍的人們，被迫重新認識了自己的國家和那些掛著勛章的上位者們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，你是怎麼獲得他們的信任——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在聽嗎，風笛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開戰術會議的時候需要聚精會神。地圖在那裡，不在我臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，隊長！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"號角輕輕嘆了口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，這問題我不該問，畢竟你可是菲奧娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是……有點高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“典範軍”，風暴突擊隊的前身。原來那些傳言是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我比較驚訝的是，你居然沒忘記軍史課的內容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然啦！以前在駐地受訓的時候，三角鐵可是監督我把這條罰抄了好多遍呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"駐地的操場邊上，岩槭長得很茂密，擋太陽正好，外面崖壁上的石頭很硬，磨得手疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得，有一回大提琴和雙簧管打賭，誰能更快完成攀岩訓練，輸的人做一百個單手伏地挺身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙簧管太傻了，誰會跟大提琴打這種賭啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那時候可沒提醒他。他做伏地挺身的時候，你還坐他背上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿。我那是，幫他加練。效果不是還不錯嗎？他後來差點就打敗大提琴了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早在風暴突擊隊成立的時候，那支四國戰爭時期的傳奇部隊就連一個空番號都不剩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是現在，它又回到了這片戰場上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，我們現在都是典範軍的一員了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的隊伍還在，我們就不會停止戰鬥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面不是在開作戰會議嗎？你怎麼在外面的冷風裡站著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……不差這幾分鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……想起誰了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德，還是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都沒想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我信你。要是這夜霧裡突然走過來一個人，我也並不會有什麼期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是誰都有號角小姐那麼幸運，還能和自己最想見的人……重逢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“幸運”嗎？真是個奢侈的詞啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……傷感的時間到此為止，我們也該進去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的軍人？是留在這裡的殘兵嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對，在他們接近之前，我居然都沒發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種素質……精銳中的精銳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特的人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呵——真冷啊，手都凍僵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這天啊，真是越來越冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是散了這一下子步，披肩就差不多濕了一半。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"高多汀公爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1068_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年輕的朋友們，真的不準備邀請我進去暖和一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……既然您願意親自出馬，那我們也該有些禮貌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_4110_delphn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維娜小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來為公爵大人引路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
